From 645ed329b06aea34c0cc27a13502278d2d765fa3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:45:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat: page the question lists with a real total, show
 load errors, make quizzes server-first, scope upload batches per browser

- GET /questions sends X-Total-Count (same filters, plain-list body unchanged) with an id tie-break so pages never overlap; Knowledge Base gets Load more and Showing N of M
- LoadErrorBanner on the quiz library, quiz page and uploads page so a failed load never looks like an empty list
- quizzes: the server is the source of truth; edits and deletes are shown as done only after it confirms, the browser copy is a labelled read-only fallback, and quizzes deleted elsewhere no longer reappear
- upload batches carry a per-browser client_id (new column + alembic 0011), so resume/cancel only touches your own batch

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
